      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ensure maximum coverage, I've included an exhaustive list of test cases for the Aegis-X firewall module. Here's the comprehensive QA plan:\n\n**Packet Inspection**\n\n* Test packet inspection for:\n\t+ TCP SYN floods\n\t+ UDP floods\n\t+ ICMP floods\n\t+ HTTP floods\n\t+ FTP floods\n\t+ SSH floods\n\t+ DNS floods\n\t+ Other common protocols\n* Verify packet inspection for:\n\t+ Source IP address spoofing\n\t+ Destination IP address spoofing\n\t+ Source port spoofing\n\t+ Destination port spoofing\n\t+ Protocol spoofing\n* Test packet inspection for:\n\t+ Malformed packets (e.g., truncated headers, invalid flags)\n\t+ Packets with missing or invalid fields\n\t+ Packets with unexpected or unknown fields\n* Verify packet inspection for:\n\t+ Packet filtering by source IP address\n\t+ Packet filtering by destination IP address\n\t+ Packet filtering by source port\n\t+ Packet filtering by destination port\n\t+ Packet filtering by protocol\n\n**VPN Tunneling**\n\n* Test VPN tunneling for:\n\t+ IKEv2 protocol\n\t+ OpenVPN protocol\n\t+ PPTP protocol\n\t+ L2TP protocol",
